      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Start by auditing your current critical roles to determine which staff members require immediate migration to hardware security keys like YubiKeys. convene with your IT and legal teams to establish a clear communication plan that sets realistic expectations and provides support resources for staff transitioning away from SMS-based methods. Piloting the rollout with a small, tech-savvy group before scaling up will help refine onboarding workflows and ensure server credentials point correctly to the FIDO2 protocol.",
