      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. so it's basically stopping them from hijacking the login mid-stream. how do we handle the actual user onboarding though? my biggest concern is the lawyers complaining that it's too complicated or that they'll lose their keys. any tips for making the transition smoother for people who aren't tech savvy?",
